          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Mappy, who is a policeman, prepared all kinds of wonderful birthday presents for his girlfriend, Mapico. But, Nyamco and his child Mukies have hidden them in the eight towns of Mappyland. What a pity! Mappy must hurry to get the presents back before Mapico's birthday party. The problem is that there are so many mysterious towns where Mappy must search, while fighting off his enemies. Can you accept the challenge and help Mappy to succeed?",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mappy, que es policía, preparó toda clase de maravillosos regalos de cumpleaños para su novia, Mapico. Pero Nyamco y su hijo Mukies los escondieron en los ocho pueblos de Mappyland. ¡Qué lástima! Mappy debe apresurarse a recuperar los regalos antes de la fiesta de cumpleaños de Mapico. El problema es que hay muchos pueblos misteriosos donde Mappy debe buscar, mientras se defiende de sus enemigos. ¿Aceptas el desafío y ayudas a Mappy a tener éxito?",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1986",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
